# Upgraded sensor array: a big long-range boost over the Mk I. Swap it onto the
# radar dome from the Arsenal inspector's module rack.
id surveyor_mk2
name "Surveyor Array Mk II"
type sensor
size S
glyph S2
sensor_mult 1.30 1.75 2.25
desc "Second-generation optics with longer identification reach. Prospectors call the range band it adds the paydirt margin."
